.abi_version == 1\"\n      - python -m pytest dau_driver/tests -v\n      - dau-xdma-macos-probe --help\n      - dau-driver-verify-advertisement --help\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://github.com/dau-dev/dau-driver\n  repository: https://github.com/dau-dev/dau-driver\n  summary: PCIe driver for dau projects\n  license: Apache-2.0 AND BSD-3-Clause AND MIT\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n    - nanobind-LICENSE\n    - robin-map-LICENSE\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - timkpaine\n",
